<title>USA: Evans sees higher fiscal 1997 results.</title>
<headline>Evans sees higher fiscal 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>BAY CITY, Texas 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evans Systems Inc said on Wednesday it expected its earnings and revenues in fiscal 1997 to substantially exceed 1996 results.</p>
<p>In its first quarter ended December 31, the company reported a net income loss of $0.26 per share, including a charges totalling $0.10 per share, versus a profit of $0.01 per share.</p>
</text>
